0..78 Comment "// The holders of the roles of inductive-recursive definitions, with a decoder"
79..122 Comment "// that departs from the canonical decoder."
123..125 Comment "//"
126..201 Comment "// The decoder\'s own fixpoint opens no stage, so the stage order refuses no"
202..280 Comment "// call of it. Its holder must answer the canonical decoder, or a decoder that"
281..318 Comment "// never answers could take the role."
319..321 Comment "//"
322..399 Comment "// The checker compares the decoder with the canonical decoder at `intro(x)`."
400..477 Comment "// This decoder calls itself on its own value, so its answer never reads to a"
478..549 Comment "// normal form. The checker refuses it, and its family\'s block with it."
550..552 Comment "//"
553..633 Comment "// - see: `model/universe/ir-codes.gandr` — the family a signature defines and"
634..660 Comment "//   its decoder, admitted"
